context:
DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/ssl/certificate_packs/{certificate_pack_id}
For a given zone, delete an advanced certificate pack.
Required: certificate_pack_id (path); zone_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/ssl/certificate_packs/{certificate_pack_id}
For a given zone, get a certificate pack.
Required: certificate_pack_id (path); zone_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/ssl/certificate_packs/{certificate_pack_id}
For a given zone, restart validation or add cloudflare branding for an advanced certificate pack. The former is only a validation operation for a Certificate Pack in a validation_timed_out status.
Required: certificate_pack_id (path); zone_id (path); body (body)

PATCH /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/ssl/verification/{certificate_pack_id}
Edit SSL validation method for a certificate pack. A PATCH request will request an immediate validation check on any certificate, and return the updated status. If a validation method is provided, the validation will be immediately attempted using that method.
Required: certificate_pack_id (path); zone_id (path); body (body)
